# --- Thousand Needles: Steelsnap, then the Shimmering Flats ---
C 1131 | Steelsnap stands at the north-west end of the canyon (17.8,19.8). Follow the road west toward Whitereach Post, then head north. Frost Nova and kite it
H Freewind Post | Saves the long run back east from Steelsnap
T 1146 | Moktar Krin. From Freewind Post run east down the canyon road onto the Shimmering Flats; he is at their western edge
