C 1104,1105,1110,1176,1175 | Loop the flats: scorpids for venom, Sparkleshell Tortoises for shells, vultures and scavengers for bones, the three basilisk types, and loot Rocket Car Rubble piles as you pass
A 1148 @ Thousand Needles, 67.5, 84.5 | Silithid hive south of Moktar Krin (67,84). Kill silithids until a Cracked Silithid Carapace drops and right-click it at once, so the parts start dropping. If the hive is too hard at your level, skip 1147 and 1148 here, and later skip T 1148, A 1184 and T 1184
C 1147,1148 | Same hive: 5 Searchers, 5 Hive Drones, 5 Invaders, plus 1 Heart, 5 Talons and 3 Intact Carapaces from any of them. Searchers (32-33) are on the north side, Drones (33-34) in the middle, Invaders (34-35) on the west edge (64,86). Pull one at a time
